{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！橋本です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はゲネプロからの記者会見、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして稽古でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーそれぞれ、明日から始まる公演に対して色んな思いがあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それが舞台上で隠せなくなる瞬間があるかもしれません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそれも、私達の舞台の一部だと思って楽しんで頂けたらと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりの急ピッチで仕上げたものですが、来てくださる皆さんに満足して帰ってもらいたいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からの公演に来れない方にも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにかしらの形で公演を伝えていきたいです(o^_^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0000-184.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はいよいよ初公演！がんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お疲れ様でした！またあした☆"}],"source":"archive"}